  "comment": "wb-021.4 (MW-ADAPTIVE-POLICY-ORGANIZATIONS-R5): the OUT-OF-FILE anchor of test/workbench-apo-ui-publish-census.test.ts (the hk9l/5jha roster pattern). rows: every judged row of test/helpers/apo-ui-publish-census.ts in census order (L, R, G, A, F, Q) - id, label and, per pin, its id and the SHA-256 of the pin as written (its JSON: a live pin's expected values; a plant's planted files, entry and expected findings, roles and inventories; a reading pin's texts and readings). tests: every test the census file registers, in order. residuals: the named residual families and their pinned quiet rows. Written from the rows as measured at the cut; the census judges its rows, its registered tests (vitest task tree, run modes) and its residual families against this file at test time, in order and both ways.",
